    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a piece about this school voucher thing going on in the district. Can you give me a quick summary of the debate? Like, what are the main reasons people think vouchers are good for kids, and why do people hate them?",
      "source": "evaluator"
