    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. It feels like a lot of the pushback comes from a place of just being afraid of change or wanting to protect the status quo. Do you think the arguments against vouchers are actually based on solid evidence, or is it mostly just political fear-mongering about losing control over the system?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
